SUMMARY:✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & Gong Meditation✨
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n## 🎶✨Cosmic Quietude: Astrology & 
 Gong Meditation✨🎶\n\n**Sunday September 6th 2:00-3:30 PM at Quietude 
 Sanctuary\, Black Mountain**\n\nJoin astrologer and sound practitioner **D
 avid Heiss of Star Sounds** for a nourishing Sunday afternoon designed to 
 help you align with the rhythms of the cosmos while settling deeply into s
 tillness\, presence\, and restoration.\nEach gathering begins with a **20-
 minute Astrology Transmission**\, exploring the current planetary transits
  and the deeper themes moving through the collective and our personal live
 s. Through an evolutionary and soul-centered lens\, David offers practical
  and inspiring insights to help you consciously navigate the energies of t
 he week ahead.\nFrom there\, participants will be guided into a **50-minut
 e Gong Sound Journey**. Surrounded by the resonant tones of planetary gong
 s\, singing bowls\, and sacred sound instruments\, you'll be invited into 
 a meditative state where the thinking mind can soften\, the nervous system
  can unwind\, and a deeper connection to Self can emerge.\nWhether you are
  seeking relaxation\, spiritual insight\, emotional renewal\, or simply a 
 quiet place to rest and reconnect\, this weekly experience offers a sacred
  pause from the busyness of everyday life.\n\n**🙏Donations Start at $33
 -Please give more if you can. If $33 is to much\, just email David at [dav
 id@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) for a special price🙏*
 *\n\nRegister here: [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-detail
 s/cosmic-quietude-astrology-gong-meditation-2)\n\n### 👤 **About David H
 eiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is an **Evolutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist*
 * devoted to guiding himself and others into deeper self-awareness through
  vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 2012\, he has worked with the transf
 ormative power of **gongs and astrology**\, following a profound awakening
  that shifted his life toward a path of healing and inner discovery.\nHis 
 work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intelligence** (understanding your soul
 ’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct vibrational experience)\n\nCreat
 ing a space where participants can **remember who they are on a deeper lev
 el**.\nHis intention is simple and precise: to help you **experience yours
 elf more fully**.\n\n**🧘‍♂️Please bring your own "sound healing n
 est"** including blankets\, pillows\, bolsters\, or any other comforts tha
 t will support you in resting deeply during the journey. **Yoga mats are p
 rovided by Quietude.**\nCome settle into stillness\, attune to the wisdom 
 of the heavens\, and allow the medicine of sound to carry you home to your
 self.\n*"As above\, so within."*
